                                "example_id": "4a7742c3-75f0-4d4c-b944-a2559fb6543e",
                                "sense_id": "c7e30a0d-aefe-3e6e-ad68-4cb67a2f5e08",
                                "text": "\"They are all alike to me.\" And indeed to a landsman, the nodding schooners around seemed run from the same mold.\n\"They ain't, though. That yaller, dirty packet with her bowsprit steeved that way, she's the Hope of Prague. Nick Brady's her skipper, the meanest man on the Banks. […]\""
